{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26133","headline":"履春冰 · 舒元舆","name":"履春冰","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"投迹清冰上，凝光动早春。\n兢兢愁陷履，步步怯移身。\n鸟照微生水，狐听或过人。\n细迁形外影，轻蹑镜中轮。\n咫尺忧偏远，危疑惧已频。\n愿坚容足分，莫使独惊神。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"舒元舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26133.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26133","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《御选唐诗》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/御選唐詩_(四庫全書本)）"}